# WazHack/ZX CONCEPT round-2 LARGE decor (multi-cell) — DRAFT for user review.
# Format: "=== name WxH cells:<attr hex per cell, ',' between cols, ';' between rows>"
# + H rows of W ('#' ink, '.' paper). One attr per 8x8 cell, PAPER black (air band, F9),
# so every cell is clash-legal by construction. Each 8x8 cell becomes one tile glyph;
# identical (glyph, attr) cells share a tile id (counted by tools/concept_screen.py).
# Animated objects list every frame as a full block (name_fN); cells that differ between
# frames are glyph-swap cells, attr cycles are declared in concept_screen.py (BIG_ANIM).

